Subject: [PATCH 2/3] =?UTF-8?q?feat(storage):=20MinIO=20=E5=8F=8C=E6=A1=B6?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E8=B7=AF=E7=94=B1=EF=BC=88D2=EF=BC=89=E2=80=94=E2=80=94origina?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ls/thumbnails=20=E6=8C=89=20key=20=E9=A6=96=E6=AE=B5=E5=88=86?=
